Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  FinalType  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  OPERATION DATE  16 AUG 01 ACCESSIONED ON  16 AUG 01 at 14 19 CLINICAL DATA  79 y o  lady with invasive right breast cancer on excisional biopsy from REMOVED_DATE                                                                                     FINAL DIAGNOSIS     LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA   SENTINEL    EXCISION  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY IN 1 EXAMINED LYMPH NODE  NOTE  Keratin immunostains are negative for tumor cells  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY  DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  GRADE 3  SPANNING AT LEAST REMOVED_DATE CM  LOCATED FAR AWAY FROM MARGINS  HEALING BIOPSY SITE  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF RESIDUAL INVASIVE CARCINOMA  Diagnosis by  MELINDA J  FAN  MD Signed On  24 AUG 01 at 17 29                                                                                 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  is a simple mastectomy specimen consisting of a right breast measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm and an overlying skin ellipse measuring REMOVED_DATE x 10 0cm  The specimen is oriented with a long suture at the lateral margin  and a short suture at the superior margin  There is a healed linear scar measuring 4 0cm on the inferior aspect of the skin ellipse and an inverted nipple  The specimen is inked black  Beneath the scar  there is a biopsy cavity measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  with fibrotic tissue surrounding it  The cavity is 0 8cm from the closest margin  which is the deep margin  and about 6 0cm to the next closet margins  Medial to the biopsy cavity is a firm nodular area measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  and is 2 0cm from the closest margin  which is the deep margin  The remaining parenchyma is unremarkable  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number is a lymph node containing blue dye  measuring REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  Also in the same container is a piece of fibrofatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  SECTION CODES  A D  Biopsy cavity with fibrotic area around  with B containing cavity closest to the deep margin  E F  Nodular area medial to biopsy cavity  G H  Normal parenchyma  I   Skin with scar  J   Sentinel lymph node  bisected  K   Fatty tissue received with sentinel lymph node  L M  Biopsy cavity  N O  Nipple  Resident  SHABIN NANJI  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Steven Michael Abbate  M D  David R Whittaker  M D  PART A  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLA  SENTINEL    EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , No.
