s an overlying REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm tan white ellipse of skin with a central linear 3 0cm partially healed  surgical incision  The anterior margin is marked with blue ink  the posterior margin is marked with black ink  the superior margin with green ink and the inferior margin with yellow ink  There is a 3 0cm in diameter biopsy cavity  which is opened to the posterior margin and lined by smooth tan tissue  The inner lining of this cavity is marked with orange ink  The cavity is located 2 5cm from the anterior margin  1 4cm to the inferior margin  1 5cm to the superior margin  greater than 2 0cm from the lateral margin  and greater than 2 0cm to the medial margin  No other masses or nodules are grossly identified  The remainder of the tissue consists mainly of adipose tissue with a scant amount of intervening soft white fibrous tissue  Representative sections are submitted as   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sections of biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sections away from cavity  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and   right breast re excision  posterior hemisphere  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm irregular portion of fibroadipose tissue with a short stitch denoting the superior margin and a long stitch the lateral margin  There is a 3 0cm in diameter biopsy cavity which opens to the anterior margin  The cavity is lined by smooth  tan tissue and is marked with orange ink  The remainder of the anterior margin is marked with blue ink  the posterior margin is marked with black ink  the superior margin with green ink and the inferior margin with yellow ink  The biopsy cavity extends to 2 0cm of the lateral margin  1 0cm to the medial margin  1 0cm to the superior margin  1 5cm to the inferior margin and 0 9cm to the posterior margin  No masses or nodules are grossly identified  The tissue consists mainly of adipose tissue with a scant amount of intervening soft  white fibrous tissue  Representative sections are submitted as