es E F  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  left breast superior skin margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm tan white wrinkled skin ellipse excised to a depth of 0 4cm  inked  sectioned  and entirely submitted ends in G  body in H  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  inferior skin margin left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm unremarkable tan white wrinkled skin ellipse excised to a depth of 0 2cm which is inked  sectioned and entirely submitted with ends in I  body in J  Gross Description by  KRISTEN SMITH Resident  JUSTIN M  CATES  MD  PhD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Rosa Sung Eun Choi  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT  SUPERIOR MARGIN    EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST  LEFT  POSTERIOR    EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART C  BREAST  LEFT  SUPERIOR SKIN MARGIN    EXCISION PART D  BREAST  LEFT  INFERIOR SKIN MARGIN    EXCISION , No.
