nd fat necrosis  The biopsy cavity is located 3 0cm from the medial margin  1 0cm from the overlying skin  and comes to within 0 6cm of the closest deep resection margin  and 0 5cm to the closest superior resection margin  and 0 8cm within the closest inferior resection margin  A second REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm tan white fibrous area is noted 1 0cm lateral to the biopsy cavity  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is tan yellow and grossly unremarkable  The axillary tail is dissected to reveal multiple lymph node  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 2 0cm in diameter  SECTION CODE  A  biopsy cavity  closest deep margin B  biopsy cavity  closest superior margin C  biopsy cavity  closest inferior margin D H  representative sections of biopsy cavity I  fibrous area 1 0cm lateral to biopsy cavity J  unremarkable breast K  representative section of nipple L R  axillary lymph nodes  Received in the same container is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm irregular ellipse of skin  The overlying epidermis is tan pink and grossly unremarkable  Representative section submitted in cassette S  Resident  Simon Bergman  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT    report_end  , Yes.
