rior and medial margins and comes to 1 6cm of the inferior  1 4cm of the anterior  and  2cm of the lateral margin  Possibly contiguous with this mass is a 3rd REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm indurated gray white mass  which abuts the posterior margin and comes to 0 3cm of the inferior margin  1 8cm of the anterior margin  and  2cm of the superior  medial and lateral margins  If the 2 more laterally located masses are contiguous  the overall measurement is 3 x 3 x 1 4cm  Representative sections are submitted from medial to lateral as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Medial margin  radially sectioned  including medial tip of mass  2   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Full thickness section  including masses  1 and  2   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  1   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  2   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  2 and  3   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Focally indurated gray white fibrous tissue extending from mass  2 to the anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Remainder of mass  3   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lateral margin  en face  Received fresh  labeled  left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm portion of tan red fibrofatty tissue with localization wire in place  The margin is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm indurated gray white nodule  which focally abuts the ink  The remaining cut surface is focally dense gray white fibrous tissue with no other discrete lesions or other gross abnormalities  The specimen is entirely submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Ends  en face   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Body with entire nodule as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh for the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN and  left axillary sentinel node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm possible lymph node with a moderate amount of attached tan yellow fat  The specimen is bisected and a representative section is frozen as FX 1  now as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   A 2nd represent